s, at the time of the participant’s death, either living  \nwith or contributing to the support of such child, as determined in accordance  \nwith such regulations as the Director shall prescribe.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"45 FR 78995, PDF pages 11-15; Sec. 1-101(b)","sha256":"26f1a0407aa6f53494712fcd0f599472e995c6875132401a0efd05d8efb14c12","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1980-11-28/pdf/FR-1980-11-28.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12253#sec1-101(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"1-102. The provisions of Section 1-101 are effective as of January 2, 1980.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"45 FR 78995, PDF pages 11-15; Sec. 1-102","sha256":"26f1a0407aa6f53494712fcd0f599472e995c6875132401a0efd05d8efb14c12","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1980-11-28/pdf/FR-1980-11-28.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12253#sec1-102","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"1-103. The Director of Central Intelligence is authorized to prescribe such  \nregulations as are necessary to carry out the provisions of this Order.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"45 FR 78995, PDF pages 11-15; Sec. 1-103","sha256":"26f1a0407aa6f53494712fcd0f599472e995c6875132401a0efd05d8efb14c12","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1980-11-28/pdf/FR-1980-11-28.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12253#sec1-103","state_at_cutoff":null}],"original_representation":{"page_or_item":"45 FR 78995, PDF pages 11-15","sha256":"26f1a0407aa6f53494712fcd0f599472e995c6875132401a0efd05d8efb14c12","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1980-11-28/pdf/FR-1980-11-28.pdf"},"research_rationale":"","savings_residuals":null,"schema":"eo-lifecycle-claim/v1","unresolved_material_gaps":["DRAFT: state_at_cutoff not decided for 5 clause(s); clause inventory completeness not confirmed","DRAFT: whole-order ending not established","DRAFT: savings and residual effects not 